WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.438 --> 00:00:03.755
Lesson one. Classroom Rules!

2
00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:11.767
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.749 --> 00:00:14.460
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:18.166
Today we learn: Classroom Rules! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.267
Listen! Say it with me. Listen!

6
00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:30.627
Look! Say it with me. Look!

7
00:00:34.571 --> 00:00:38.187
Sit down! Say it with me. Sit down!

8
00:00:42.191 --> 00:00:45.791
Stand up! Say it with me. Stand up!

9
00:00:49.852 --> 00:00:53.919
Raise hand! Say it with me. Raise hand!

10
00:00:57.895 --> 00:01:01.678
Be quiet! Say it with me. Be quiet!

11
00:01:05.721 --> 00:01:09.587
Line up! Say it with me. Line up!

12
00:01:13.513 --> 00:01:16.847
Share! Say it with me. Share!

13
00:01:20.913 --> 00:01:27.137
Listen. Please listen. Don't run in class.

14
00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:31.858
Say it with me. Please listen. Don't run in class.

15
00:01:36.689 --> 00:01:41.950
Please listen to the teacher and look at the board. Raise your hand before you speak.

16
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.205
I like this story!

17
00:01:44.092 --> 00:01:49.349
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.399 --> 00:01:50.549
Sit down!

19
00:01:51.599 --> 00:01:56.814
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:56.864 --> 00:01:58.014
Be quiet!

21
00:01:59.148 --> 00:02:06.469
Value corner: Kindness. Being kind means being gentle and caring to others, even in small ways.

22
00:02:06.519 --> 00:02:08.266
I can show kindness too!

23
00:02:09.016 --> 00:02:16.082
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:16.132 --> 00:02:17.750
Bye-bye, friends!

